WEBVTT

00:01.430 --> 00:04.530
Leaving behind countless thousands of tears

00:04.530 --> 00:08.170
My thoughts travel the wilderness

00:08.170 --> 00:16.100
The wounds will heal someday,
so come, trust myself

00:21.250 --> 00:27.760
Under the scorching rays of the sun,
what thoughts cross your mind?

00:27.760 --> 00:33.700
What does your grief-stricken gaze reflect now?

00:33.700 --> 00:42.640
If I can keep from losing my way,
step by step, it should be easy

00:42.640 --> 00:47.410
Like the wind

00:47.410 --> 00:50.480
Leaving behind countless thousands of tears

00:50.480 --> 00:54.080
I travel the dawn-lit wilderness

00:54.080 --> 01:00.520
The wounds will heal someday,
so come, trust myself

01:00.520 --> 01:07.330
Don't be afraid, change is
nothing to be frightened of

01:07.330 --> 01:13.440
As long as you are yourself, I will be with you

01:13.440 --> 01:20.180
Dreaming of tranquil days

01:20.180 --> 01:27.410
The roadless journey continues

01:48.700 --> 01:53.640
It's a good thing I handed
one of these to the girls.

01:53.640 --> 01:55.580
How's your wound?

01:55.580 --> 01:57.310
It's fine.

02:01.850 --> 02:05.420
O one possessed of an unsullied soul...

02:05.420 --> 02:08.590
O one who pays heed to a voiceless voice

02:08.590 --> 02:11.250
and discerns its true meaning...

02:16.330 --> 02:17.800
What is it?

02:48.630 --> 02:50.360
There.

02:57.910 --> 03:01.360
So that's... the witches' village.

03:16.790 --> 03:19.690
We're really here, aren't we?

03:26.900 --> 03:28.930
I thought it was that man.

03:30.970 --> 03:33.640
Ellis? Wait.

03:33.640 --> 03:35.980
Ellis, what is it?

03:35.980 --> 03:37.640
There.

03:41.950 --> 03:44.420
- This is...
- Let's go.

03:44.420 --> 03:45.910
Ellis?

03:48.690 --> 03:51.230
I wonder how far this goes...

03:51.230 --> 03:52.780
Almost there.

04:02.340 --> 04:04.000
What is this place?

04:17.850 --> 04:19.910
Wiñay Marka.

04:25.630 --> 04:27.620
An Inca rose...

04:29.330 --> 04:31.470
I have been waiting for you.

04:31.470 --> 04:36.470
This is the sacred ground, where the
witches of old offered their prayers.

04:36.470 --> 04:38.340
Rosenberg...

04:38.340 --> 04:41.840
It has long been in a state of slumber,

04:41.840 --> 04:43.640
but take a look.

04:47.380 --> 04:49.820
In response to Ellis's powers,

04:49.820 --> 04:52.720
the power this place once
had has been restored.

04:52.720 --> 04:55.520
We've heard enough of your
melodramatic exposition,

04:55.520 --> 04:57.630
so tell us the answer.

04:57.630 --> 05:02.600
Kill me and the truth will be
obscured for all eternity.

05:02.600 --> 05:04.570
I won't kill you, so don't worry.

05:04.570 --> 05:07.470
But I will make it hurt so much
that you'll wish you were dead.

05:16.940 --> 05:18.910
Ellis, stay close to me.

05:18.910 --> 05:20.640
Yessir.

05:33.060 --> 05:35.760
- Nadie!
- Ellis.

05:49.940 --> 05:51.670
Nadie?

05:55.350 --> 05:58.750
If you have any last words, say them now.

05:58.750 --> 06:01.860
- Ellis.
- Tell me.

06:01.860 --> 06:03.880
The real answer.

06:06.890 --> 06:08.690
Very well.

06:24.780 --> 06:26.770
Rosenberg...

06:30.150 --> 06:33.760
Run, Ellis...

06:33.760 --> 06:37.120
- Doctor...
- You have to run...

06:39.460 --> 06:43.160
You were not the one who killed Dr. Schneider.

06:43.160 --> 06:46.500
It was me.

06:46.500 --> 06:48.470
Why would you do such a thing?

06:48.470 --> 06:50.670
Because, awakening Ellis

06:50.670 --> 06:55.740
required the death of someone she
loved from the bottom of her heart.

06:55.740 --> 07:01.120
Yes. He was a sacrifice,
just as you are, Nadie.

07:01.120 --> 07:02.950
I'm not going to die.

07:02.950 --> 07:07.660
I absolutely refuse to be used
in your petty quest for vengeance.

07:07.660 --> 07:10.630
- Vengeance?
- Don't play dumb.

07:10.630 --> 07:14.630
I know everything about
why you're doing all this.

07:14.630 --> 07:18.670
You're trying to use Ellis
to avenge your father.

07:18.670 --> 07:22.740
Oh, that.

07:22.740 --> 07:25.640
You misunderstand me.

07:25.640 --> 07:30.210
My objective is not revenge.

07:30.210 --> 07:33.950
After Project Leviathan was suspended,

07:33.950 --> 07:40.660
I secretly secured custody of Ellis
and left her in Dr. Schneider's care.

07:40.660 --> 07:43.490
The Doctor and Ellis came
to understand one another

07:43.490 --> 07:45.820
and they gradually grew closer together.

08:18.960 --> 08:24.030
Innocent Ellis soaked up the
Doctor's kindness with all her being

08:24.030 --> 08:28.490
and day-by-day, she became
more beautifully radiant.

08:33.710 --> 08:38.010
Oh, my dear, dear Ellis.

08:38.010 --> 08:40.950
You just had to fall in love with the Doctor.

08:45.590 --> 08:47.050
Ellis!

08:47.050 --> 08:51.060
But that was also what I had hoped for.

08:51.060 --> 08:52.890
Rosenberg...

08:54.830 --> 08:57.130
Ellis!

08:57.130 --> 09:00.770
Ellis, you are far too beautiful

09:00.770 --> 09:03.970
and I am too lowly to even touch you...

09:03.970 --> 09:05.910
What he's saying is a lie!

09:05.910 --> 09:09.740
- Ellis!
- Rosenberg!

09:09.740 --> 09:12.310
I am in love with you!

09:12.310 --> 09:14.040
Ellis!

09:19.020 --> 09:22.260
I have hereby taken delivery of Ellis.

09:22.260 --> 09:26.930
Nadie, you will now die for me.

09:26.930 --> 09:30.130
A mantle of rainbow-colored
light soars the heavens...

09:34.140 --> 09:37.300
Gallant is the dance of flames
that rend the land asunder...

09:41.940 --> 09:43.670
Ellis?!

09:44.980 --> 09:47.970
The roar of the spray in frenzied tumult...

09:50.690 --> 09:54.190
They are all the culmination of deviltry...

09:54.190 --> 09:57.620
Where the crimson essence ultimately leads...

10:06.970 --> 10:10.070
I have long waited for Ellis's awakening,

10:10.070 --> 10:12.600
and it is finally about to become reality!

10:21.850 --> 10:23.340
That's!

10:29.790 --> 10:31.260
Let's go!

11:02.860 --> 11:04.390
I'm sorry.

11:04.390 --> 11:07.030
I'm sorry, Ellis.

11:07.030 --> 11:11.430
It doesn't look like... I can...

11:11.430 --> 11:14.340
...protect you anymore.

11:14.340 --> 11:17.000
Nadie...

11:17.000 --> 11:22.110
I can't hold on anymore, either.

11:22.110 --> 11:25.880
My memories of the time I spent with you...

11:25.880 --> 11:28.180
They're about to disappear...

11:39.990 --> 11:41.690
Nadie.

11:58.110 --> 12:00.410
Keep the change.

12:00.410 --> 12:03.110
Keep the change?

12:04.750 --> 12:08.920
Ellis, don't tell me... you...

12:08.920 --> 12:12.090
A job for you, Nadie.

12:12.090 --> 12:16.430
Shoot... me.

12:16.430 --> 12:18.800
Don't be ridiculous.

12:18.800 --> 12:24.240
Kill... me...

12:24.240 --> 12:27.040
There's no way... I could ever...

12:27.040 --> 12:31.010
Please, Nadie.

12:31.010 --> 12:34.080
Ellis...

12:34.080 --> 12:36.250
I don't want this.

12:36.250 --> 12:39.820
I don't want to be used by that man like this...

12:39.820 --> 12:43.790
Nor do I want to harm
someone with my powers...

12:43.790 --> 12:47.360
I absolutely don't want those things... so...

12:47.360 --> 12:49.160
Ellis...

12:49.160 --> 12:51.070
Please.

12:51.070 --> 12:53.100
But...

12:53.100 --> 12:59.240
This is the only... way... now...

12:59.240 --> 13:01.440
B-But...

13:03.440 --> 13:06.850
Before my memories disappear...

13:06.850 --> 13:08.780
Hurry...

13:13.020 --> 13:14.920
Nadie.

13:20.860 --> 13:24.430
I understand, Ellis.

13:24.430 --> 13:30.300
I hereby verify...
that I have accepted this job.

13:30.300 --> 13:32.270
Thank you.

13:36.540 --> 13:40.450
If you have any last words, say them now.

13:42.350 --> 13:46.850
I love you, Nadie.

13:46.850 --> 13:48.560
Ellis...

13:48.560 --> 13:50.490
Don't...

14:00.230 --> 14:03.070
The witch's power vanished!

14:25.460 --> 14:27.930
I'm sorry...

14:27.930 --> 14:32.300
...that I couldn't save you.

14:32.300 --> 14:36.870
But at the very least,
I won't let you be all alone...

14:36.870 --> 14:41.170
Because I'll be...
coming over there soon, too...

15:02.030 --> 15:05.230
Ellis! Nadie!

15:05.230 --> 15:07.220
Hang in there, you two!

15:16.540 --> 15:18.010
What's wrong?!

15:18.010 --> 15:21.380
They're both... dead.

15:21.380 --> 15:25.190
- What did you say?
- No, this can't be.

15:25.190 --> 15:29.460
Open your eyes, Ellis! Wake up, Nadie!

15:29.460 --> 15:31.290
I'm begging you!

15:35.130 --> 15:39.190
You, too, possess the power of witchcraft.

15:41.300 --> 15:43.000
Lirio?!

15:43.000 --> 15:46.130
Have faith, Blue-eyes.

15:48.480 --> 15:51.610
I-Is this?

15:51.610 --> 15:55.420
A mantle of rainbow-colored
light soars the heavens...

15:55.420 --> 15:59.250
Gallant is the dance of flames
that rend the land asunder...

15:59.250 --> 16:02.360
The roar of the spray in frenzied tumult...

16:02.360 --> 16:05.560
They are all the culmination of deviltry...

16:05.560 --> 16:09.090
Where the crimson essence ultimately leads...

16:16.640 --> 16:18.430
Blue-eyes!

16:32.350 --> 16:34.080
Lirio!

16:45.270 --> 16:47.330
I was able to use it, too...

16:47.330 --> 16:50.100
The powers of a witch...

16:52.070 --> 16:54.740
- Cold...
- Nadie!

16:54.740 --> 16:56.730
Hey, do it again!

17:00.780 --> 17:02.580
Splendid!

17:02.580 --> 17:09.160
I never imagined that Miss Hayward
would awaken her witch's powers.

17:09.160 --> 17:12.330
A witch's powers are awakened
through the death of a loved one.

17:12.330 --> 17:15.360
Through profound grief.

17:15.360 --> 17:16.800
Blue-eyes,

17:16.800 --> 17:21.800
it seems you loved Nadie and Ellis
from the very bottom of your heart.

17:21.800 --> 17:25.540
You saved my Ellis.

17:25.540 --> 17:27.630
I am truly grateful.

17:29.640 --> 17:31.250
What are you up to?

17:31.250 --> 17:35.240
The power of the Inca rose
is no longer necessary.

17:42.660 --> 17:46.660
Ellis, let us begin the journey all over again.

17:46.660 --> 17:51.500
I shall acquire a new sacrifice
to take Nadie's place.

17:53.630 --> 17:56.540
Now, come over here.

18:50.420 --> 18:52.120
Ellis...

19:08.810 --> 19:11.210
Doctor...

19:11.210 --> 19:14.450
Thank you, Ellis.

19:14.450 --> 19:16.180
Ellis?!

19:19.190 --> 19:21.760
- It's dangerous to stay here any longer!
- But...

19:21.760 --> 19:25.160
There is no need to worry.

19:25.160 --> 19:27.900
The witch created by man's hands

19:27.900 --> 19:33.700
has acquired the means
to use her powers properly.

19:33.700 --> 19:36.770
And in turn, we shall surely be
allowed tranquility in our hearts

19:36.770 --> 19:40.600
to walk down the path towards oblivion...

20:05.930 --> 20:11.910
Deep inside this small bosom

20:11.910 --> 20:19.750
There is such vibrant life

20:19.750 --> 20:25.690
I want to take the secret
to why the world is so dear

20:25.690 --> 20:33.680
And reveal it with beautiful magic

20:47.370 --> 20:54.850
Though ignorant of anything
akin to the reason why I was born

20:54.850 --> 21:01.520
Look, spring has come to the desert

21:01.520 --> 21:08.760
It made me want to take someone
smiling next to me and hold them tight

21:08.760 --> 21:14.930
So bursting with love was I

21:17.340 --> 21:20.360
If you have any last words, say them now.

21:42.930 --> 21:44.620
Ellis...

21:50.970 --> 21:54.640
I...

21:54.640 --> 21:56.510
...envy you.

22:10.820 --> 22:17.800
I was born to learn what it is to cherish

22:17.800 --> 22:22.870
Now, I will go forward in pursuit of love

22:22.870 --> 22:27.940
Cazador...

22:27.940 --> 22:29.580
Cazador...
And thus, these two...

22:29.580 --> 22:30.740
And thus, these two...

22:30.740 --> 22:34.410
...ended their long journey.

22:36.550 --> 22:40.350
Like a neverending summer

22:40.350 --> 22:43.790
Like flowers that never die

22:43.790 --> 22:47.690
Those arms you've wrapped around me

22:47.690 --> 22:55.830
Don't ever let go of me

23:02.040 --> 23:05.650
Even if I try clinging to you

23:05.650 --> 23:11.450
My heart still heeds a different evanescence

23:11.450 --> 23:15.420
Counting the rhythm of time by it

23:15.420 --> 23:19.530
A night of red stars

23:19.530 --> 23:23.530
The vanishing warmth

23:23.530 --> 23:27.470
I want to keep it here

23:27.470 --> 23:33.870
You, with your eyes closed

23:33.870 --> 23:37.840
Yearning over and over

23:37.840 --> 23:41.180
Even if I can't go anywhere

23:41.180 --> 23:45.420
When the heartache comes to a stop

23:45.420 --> 23:51.730
To the two of us, this moment is...

23:51.730 --> 23:56.720
...everything
